# @codebar-ag/storybook is published to GitHub Packages, not npmjs.com.
#
# Only the registry mapping is committed. The credential is read from the
# GITHUB_TOKEN environment variable at install time and is never stored here —
# npm expands ${GITHUB_TOKEN} itself.
#
# The token needs the `read:packages` scope. Without it `npm ci` cannot resolve
# the package, so every install, build and CI run fails.
@codebar-ag:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
